this is an extended chp file, our extension is the defflow instruction, where, like in stim, we can use flow representation of a circuit in the simulator.
for example, we can use:
defflow h {
  x -> z; 
  z -> x;
}
to define a custom h gate 
#
defflow ch {
  x -> z; 
  z -> x;
}
ch 2
c 2 3

c 1 2
h 2
c 0 2
h 2

c 2 4
c 4 2

c 4 3
h 4
m 4
m 3